# Salidas empaquetadas. El rollup de este plugin escribe en `dist-js/`
# (formatos `esm` y `cjs`, según `exports` en package.json); un `*-iife.js`
# en la raíz no lo genera ninguna configuración y no lo publica `files`.
*-iife.js

# Cargo.lock is intentionally tracked so that a build of this crate on its own
# (`cargo build` here, `cargo install`) resolves the same versions every time.
# It does not pin what a consuming application builds: that is the application's
# own Cargo.lock, which is where a VasakOS app pins and maintains its
# dependency versions.

# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/
